{"intents":[{"id":"mve7ubj2-f3ne9z","focus":"abundance","desire":"A home by the sea","feeling":"peaceful","createdAt":"2026-10-18T19:26:00.926Z","usedIds":["op9","ar-ab6","se10","li-ab3","wi7","gr1","cl6","t2"],"chapter":1},{"id":"mve7tc04-8kywog","focus":"career","desire":"my own design studio, with clients who trust my eye","feeling":"proud","createdAt":"2026-10-18T19:25:14.884Z","usedIds":["op1","ar-ca6","se8","li-ca5","wi5","gr7","cl8","t1","op7","ar-ca2","se3","li-ca3","wi7","gr6","cl2","t7"],"chapter":2}],"stories":[{"id":"mve7ubk6-4e83fu","intentId":"mve7ubj2-f3ne9z","title":"After the Wanting","paragraphs":[{"fragmentId":"op9","text":"No scramble, no dread, no list running before your feet touch the floor. Just morning, and you, and the life that answered."},{"fragmentId":"ar-ab6","text":"You tip well. You book the trip. You breathe. Enough stopped being a ceiling and became a floor: A home by the sea."},{"fragmentId":"se10","text":"Your own handwriting in the margin of today's list looks different lately. Rounder. Unclenched."},{"fragmentId":"li-ab3","text":"An opportunity lands in your inbox — the paid kind, the aligned kind. They find you regularly now, like the address finally got listed."},{"fragmentId":"wi7","text":"Someone younger watches how you move through the day and quietly adjusts their own sails. You remember being them. You'd have loved proof like you."},{"fragmentId":"gr1","text":"Gratitude arrives on its own now, uninvited, mid-afternoon — for the ordinary furniture of a life you once begged the sky for."},{"fragmentId":"cl6","text":"Sleep takes you gently, the way it takes people with nothing to flee. Tomorrow will rhyme with today. That's the whole plan now."}],"createdAt":"2026-10-18T19:26:00.966Z"},{"id":"mve7u3o9-dxcgnl","intentId":"mve7tc04-8kywog","title":"After the Wanting","paragraphs":[{"fragmentId":"op7","text":"The day doesn't ask anything of you yet. It just waits, warm and unhurried, while you remember who you've become."},{"fragmentId":"ar-ca2","text":"The first task of the day is one you'd do for free — and they pay you well for it. Strange and wonderful, how the intention held: my own design studio, with clients who trust my eye."},{"fragmentId":"se3","text":"The air outside smells faintly of rain that already fell. Everything is rinsed, including — somehow — you."},{"fragmentId":"li-ca3","text":"You decline a shiny thing that isn't yours to do, and the calendar breathes. Mastery is mostly subtraction, you've learned."},{"fragmentId":"wi7","text":"Someone younger watches how you move through the day and quietly adjusts their own sails. You remember being them. You'd have loved proof like you."},{"fragmentId":"gr6","text":"Somewhere in the day you feel it land — that this was once the dream. This exact, ordinary, extraordinary Tuesday. You feel proud, all the way through."},{"fragmentId":"cl2","text":"You set tomorrow's one intention like a cup by the kettle, then let the day go completely. Sleep comes down like warm weather."},{"fragmentId":"proof-2","text":"There is proof behind this memory now: Sent my portfolio to two studios I admire.. It is small enough to be real, and real enough to change what comes next."}],"createdAt":"2026-10-18T19:25:50.746Z"}],"actions":[{"id":"mve7ubk7-78z3z3","intentId":"mve7ubj2-f3ne9z","storyId":"mve7ubk6-4e83fu","text":"Move one small amount toward the future you described.","state":"completed","createdAt":"2026-10-18T19:26:00.967Z","evidence":"Saved the first two hundred for the deposit.","evidenceKind":"moved","completedAt":"2026-10-18T19:26:31.621Z"},{"id":"mve7u3oa-tespk","intentId":"mve7tc04-8kywog","storyId":"mve7u3o9-dxcgnl","text":"Protect twenty focused minutes for the skill your future self relies on.","state":"open","createdAt":"2026-10-18T19:25:50.746Z"},{"id":"mve7tc08-4pyzwx","intentId":"mve7tc04-8kywog","storyId":"mve7tc07-ec8e0d","text":"Create one visible piece of work, however small, before consuming advice.","state":"completed","createdAt":"2026-10-18T19:25:14.887Z","evidence":"Sent my portfolio to two studios I admire.","evidenceKind":"did","completedAt":"2026-10-18T19:25:42.000Z"}]}